4.7 Layer 7 – Atomic Fusion Algorithm

Purpose: Multi‑model cognitive fusion.

Implementation:

Sensor Ingestion:

· Apache Kafka on Plane B, partitioned by segment.
· Each sensor type has a dedicated topic; schemas managed by Protobuf.
· Kafka Streams (Java) performs lightweight filtering and aggregation.

Fusion Model:

