· Input window: 60 seconds of historical data (10 Hz for critical, 1 Hz for non‑critical).
· Output: probabilistic forecast for next 10 seconds, plus anomaly score.

Serving:

· ONNX Runtime on GPU nodes.
· Model updated weekly via online learning (incremental gradient descent).

World Model API:

· gRPC server streaming WorldModel messages.
· WorldModel contains tensors for temperature, strain, radiation, position of all known objects.

