4.8 Layer 8 – Nuclear Intelligence (QNI)

Purpose: Certified autonomous fusion reactor control.

Implementation:

Software Architecture:

· Three independent channels (A, B, C) per reactor.
· Each channel runs formally verified SPARK Ada code.
· Plasma control: Nonlinear model predictive control (NMPC) solved by ACADO Toolkit (auto‑generated C code).

Voting Mechanism:

· Outputs compared in hardware (FPGA TMR voter).
· If any channel disagrees, it is reset and subjected to built‑in self‑test.

Safety Monitor:

· Independent watchdog timer, diverse programming (C vs Ada).
· If safety constraints are violated, reactor trips in <2 ms.

