7. Monitoring, Logging, and Observability Implementation

7.1 Metrics

· Prometheus exporters on every node, aggregating hardware and application metrics.
· Grafana dashboards for real‑time monitoring (ground only; in orbit, dashboards are viewed via downlinked snapshots).

7.2 Logging

· Fluent Bit runs as a daemonset on each node, shipping logs to an Elasticsearch cluster on the ground.
· Critical logs are also stored locally in a ring buffer for post‑event analysis.

7.3 Tracing

